  "_doc": "Single source of truth for transpile scope. Whitelist semantics: a namespace is in scope iff the LONGEST matching prefix (case-insensitive, on a dot boundary) comes from include. No match means out of scope. An exclude entry wins over a shorter include prefix, and a tie goes to exclude. Microsoft is whitelisted whole -- this is a full BC clone and not a subset -- minus the explicit glue carve-outs. System.* is whitelisted per sub-namespace, because platform glue lives there. Taken from the predecessor, ~/Git/openerp/scripts/transpiler/scope.json, where it was arrived at over the whole BaseApp.",
